title:  Snappier UI: no busy waits (debug serial port, and 50 ms after every frame)
desc:   debug messages no longer wait ~87 us per character for an internal serial port nobody reads (about 1.2 kB per page change); after each frame the screen task sleeps its 50 ms instead of spinning, so Bluetooth / ANT (Di2) and map work run meanwhile
